Third-party data
----------------
The per-question result files under evals/*/proof/ contain material from
third-party benchmark datasets. That material is not covered by the Apache
License and stays under the dataset's own license:

- LongMemEval (Wu et al., ICLR 2025; https://github.com/xiaowu0162/LongMemEval),
  used via https://huggingface.co/datasets/xiaowu0162/longmemeval-cleaned:
  MIT License. Gold answers (truncated) in evals/longmemeval/proof/.
- LoCoMo (Maharana et al., ACL 2024; https://github.com/snap-research/locomo):
  Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 (CC BY-NC 4.0). Questions
  and gold answers (truncated) in evals/locomo/proof/; non-commercial use only.

The datasets themselves are not redistributed; the harnesses download them.
